X:1
T:Roxanne
C:Sting (The Police)
M:4/4
O:England, 1978
N:Verse 1 (bars 1-9) and the chorus riff (bars 10-19). Melody from channel 3 of a MIDI arrangement (hamienet.com, track 352643340026570); chords from its guitar and bass channels, none marked in bars 1, 8 and 9 because the arrangement plays none there. Not transposed: D4 is the lowest note, so G minor is already the lowest key that fits C4. The same channel carries the sustained chorus harmony pads (stacked thirds from C5 to A#5, held for 5 beats). They sound under the lead, so they are left out and every second chorus bar is a rest. Humanized onsets snapped to the sixteenth grid; releases a sixteenth short of the next note are filled in. The earlier arrangement (track 5132) agrees on every verse note. In chorus entry 2 (bar 12) the second note is A#4 (B-flat), as in that track and in the other four entries; track 352643340026570 has C5 there. Track 5132 also starts each chorus entry on the beat with a quarter-note C5, where this one starts an eighth later.
